11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[81,90,62,55,66,93],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1019305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[81,90,62,55,66,93],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1019305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[81,90,62,55,66,93],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1019305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1039","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[81,90,62,55,66,93],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"900","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1009505","helmet":"WP1019305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将，诸葛瞻之子，诸葛亮之孙。诸葛尚博览兵书且精通武艺。邓艾偷渡阴平、进取绵竹时，与父亲诸葛瞻前往应战，并仅靠一人之力便击退邓忠、师篡二将。后劝诸葛瞻等吴援军抵达后再战，瞻不听，遂以十九岁之龄在绵竹之战中力敌魏军名将邓忠、师纂，最终壮烈殉国，成为蜀汉政权覆灭前最后一抹血色光芒。","tc":"蜀國武將，諸葛瞻之子，諸葛亮之孫。諸葛尚博覽兵書且精通武藝。鄧艾偷渡陰平、進取綿竹時，與父親諸葛瞻前往應戰，并僅靠一人之力便擊退鄧忠、師篡二將。后勸諸葛瞻等吳援軍抵達后再戰，瞻不聽，遂以十九歲之齡在綿竹之戰中力敵魏軍名將鄧忠、師纂，最終壯烈殉國，成為蜀漢政權覆滅前最后一抹血色光芒。","en":"Officer of Shu, son of Zhuge Zhan and grandson of Zhuge Liang. Zhuge Shang was well-versed in military texts and highly skilled in martial arts. When Deng Ai crossed Yinping and advanced on Mianzhu, he rode out with his father to meet the enemy, single-handedly driving back the Wei generals Deng Zhong and Shi Zuan. He urged his father to wait for Wu reinforcements before engaging again, but Zhuge Zhan refused. At just nineteen years of age, Zhuge Shang fought valiantly against Deng Zhong and Shi Zuan at Mianzhu before falling gloriously in battle, becoming the last crimson flash before the fall of the Shu-Han regime.","jp":"蜀の武将。諸葛瞻の子で、諸葛亮の孫。諸葛尚は兵書を博捜し、武芸にも精通していた。鄧艾が陰平を密かに越えて綿竹へ進軍した際、父の諸葛瞻と共に出陣して迎え撃ち、単身で鄧忠・師纂の二将を撃退した。後に呉の援軍が到着するのを待って再戦するよう諸葛瞻を諫めたが聞き入れられず、綿竹の戦いにて十九歳の若さで魏軍の名将である鄧忠や師纂と力戦し、最後は壮烈な殉国を遂げた。蜀漢政権が滅亡する直前、最後に放たれた鮮血の光芒となった。","kr":"촉나라의 무장으로, 제갈첨의 아들이자 제갈량의 손자이다. 제갈상은 병서를 두루 섭렵하였을 뿐만 아니라 무예에도 정통했다. 등애가 음평을 몰래 넘어 면죽으로 진격해 오자 아버지 제갈첨과 함께 요격에 나섰고, 홀로 위나라 장수 등충과 사찬을 격퇴했다. 이후 오나라 원군이 당도한 뒤에 싸울 것을 제갈첨에게 간하였으나 제갈첨이 이를 듣지 않았다. 결국 열아홉의 나이로 면죽 전투에서 위군 명장 등충과 사찬에 맞서 결사적으로 싸우다 끝내 장렬히 순국하였으니, 촉한 정권이 멸망하기 직전 타오른 마지막 핏빛 섬광으로 남았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10252","remark":"","surname":"诸葛","surnameTc":"諸葛","surnameEn":"Zhuge","surnameJp":"諸葛","surnameKr":"제갈","surnameOther":"","name":"尚","nameTc":"尚","nameEn":"Shang","nameJp":"尚","nameKr":"상","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"诸葛尚","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"260","city":"CS1039","gender":"0","rule":"81","force":"90","wise":"62","politics":"55","charm":"66","will":"93","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"15","weaponMaster":"90/39/72/39/39/22/56/39","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1004002;1004202;1003600","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000805;S1003005","battleSoul":"1012105","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6500","battleSoulPoint":"8200","debateSoulPoint":"3800","s